{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09271","headline":"往云门郊居涂经廻流作 · 韦应物","name":"往云门郊居涂经廻流作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兹晨乃休暇，适往田家庐。\n原谷径涂涩，春阳草木敷。\n才遵板桥曲，复此清涧纡。\n崩壑方见射，廻流忽已舒。\n明灭泛孤景，杳霭含夕虚。\n无将爲邑志，一酌澄波余。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09271.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09271","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}